{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>If her father utterly refuses to give her to him.</b> I have only her father — whence her own self? Scripture says מאן ימאן — in any case. <b>As the bride-price of virgins.</b> Those explained elsewhere are ones taken by force; just as there it is fifty, so too here it is fifty. And just as here they are shekels, as it is written 'יִשְׁקֹל' (he shall weigh), so too there, in 'בְּמָאנֵס' (by force), they are shekels."], :book :exodus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:59:48.702763340Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}